	(text "Design Notes (Task 49 - BMS_5S_FULL_SYSTEM):\n- BQ76920: 5S RC input filters (1k / 1uF diff), CAP1=1uF, 10k NTC on TS1, 2mR low-side shunt Kelvin sense (100R / 100nF).\n- BQ76200: 470nF charge pump cap VDDCP-to-BAT, common-drain back-to-back high-side NFETs (Q1 CHG, Q2 DSG) with 100R gate + 10M G-S.\n- SN65HVD230: Powered from BQ76920 3.3V REGOUT (+3V3); 10k slope control, split 120R termination, TVS ESD protection."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.02 342.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0f7fd194-987f-465e-bbb8-ebbbe53199e5")
	)
